<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115703" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίζω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίω</span></b> : from the former we have fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψιῶ </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-ψιεῖ</span>) <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>, pf.
		
			Pass.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔψισμαι</span> (v. infr.): from the latter,
			aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔψῑσα,</span>
		fut.
		
			Med.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίσομαι [ῑ</span>], v. infr.,
		cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμψίω</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feed on pap,</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψωμίζω</span>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1631.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, etc.), or 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτίζω</span>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Orion
				<u>Lex.</u>
			</span></i>col.<i><span class="en">
				168
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκῷ σ᾽ ἔψισα
			γάλακτι</span> (Meineke for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔψησα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				92
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>chew,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίσεται πύρνον γνάθῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					639
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be fed,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὑμέων ἐψισμένον</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέφος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.302
			</span></i> (Antip.).</div>
